sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant Auth
    participant Agent as admin-service
    participant Graph as LangGraph
    participant Sec as security-service
    participant Preprocessing as preprocessing-service
    participant Retrieval as retrieval-service

    Admin->>UI: Demander un changement RAG
    UI->>Auth: Verifier la session
    Auth-->>UI: Session valide
    UI->>Agent: Envoyer le reglage
    Agent->>Graph: Classifier l'intention
    Graph->>Preprocessing: Lire le chunking actuel
    Preprocessing-->>Graph: Parametres actuels
    Graph->>Retrieval: Lire le reranking actuel
    Retrieval-->>Graph: Parametres actuels
    Graph->>Sec: Verifier l'autorisation
    Sec-->>Graph: Autorisation
    Graph-->>UI: Demander confirmation
    Admin->>UI: Confirmer le reglage
    UI->>Graph: Appliquer le changement

    alt Reglage de chunking
        Graph->>Preprocessing: Mettre a jour le chunking
        Preprocessing-->>Graph: Reglage applique
    else Reglage de reranking / retrieval
        Graph->>Retrieval: Mettre a jour le reranking
        Retrieval-->>Graph: Reglage applique
    end

    Graph-->>UI: Retourner l'etat
    UI-->>Admin: Afficher la confirmation
